                                         This modifies GTM_CMU_CLK_6_CTRL[CLK_CNT].
                                         Hence the final clock frequency will be,
                                         Signal chosen by CmuClk6SourceSelect /(Divider value configured here + 1)</L-2>
                          </DESC>
